- **Identified Solver Optimization Artifact (The Teleportation Bug):** * *The Issue:* The UAV immediately appeared on the far right side of the cage on Frame 1, failing to display a left-to-right horizontal tracking transit.
  * *The Cause:* Because TOPA operates as a memoryless positioning engine that analyzes each frame freshly from scratch to minimize link loss, it immediately calculated the absolute optimal destination for the external target on frame 1. The script immediately assigned `uav_current_pos = optimal_pos`, causing the drone to instantly "teleport" to the right wall rather than showing a flight path transiting across the cage from the left side.

